@startuml
actor User
participant "App" as App
participant "Auth Backend" as Auth
participant "Email Provider" as Email

== Login ==
User -> App: Submit credentials
App -> Auth: Login request
Auth --> App: Success/Failure response

== Forgot Password ==
User -> App: Request reset
App -> Auth: Forgot password request
Auth -> Email: Send reset link
Email --> User: Reset email
User -> App: Submit new password via link
App -> Auth: Reset password request
Auth --> App: Reset result
@enduml
